OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists told to steer clear of
OL,4,A'dangerous' bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are being urged not to
OL,7,Finterfere with barriers put in place to
OL,8,Fstop traffic using a weakened bridge in
OL,9,FHolderness.
OL,11,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council has
OL,12,Fclosed Lambwath Bridge in Skirlaugh due
OL,13,Fto its "dangerous condition".
OL,15,FBut farmer Guy Shelby said the bridge
OL,16,Fhad been weak for years, and it had not
OL,17,Fstopped him taking combines and
OL,18,Ftractors across it. The alternative
OL,19,Froute would add about 12 miles to the
OL,20,Fjourney.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
