OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists told to steer clear of
OL,4,A'dangerous' bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fstructure was likely to be replaced
OL,8,Fwith a reinforced concrete bridge, and
OL,9,Furged people not to drive vehicles
OL,10,Facross it in the meantime.
